The layout this config implements follows Hands Down Promethium by moutis
(https://github.com/moutis/HandsDown) and the Miryoku layer system by
manna-harbour (https://github.com/manna-harbour/miryoku). The structure of this
config mirrors moutis' own ZMK config (https://github.com/moutis/zmk-config),
which is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2025 moutis. No file from either project is
included here; a keyboard layout is a system rather than an expressive work, so
what is owed upstream is credit, and it is given.
